    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485860/extras/0e26e143aa46683671e2a08a6cf7f00a.poster.avif?t=1748604872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485860/extras/0e26e143aa46683671e2a08a6cf7f00a.webm?t=1748604872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WANDERER: Broken Bed is a hentai adventure game with dating-sim, point-and-click and RPG elements that will take you to a world of pleasures. Our hero is just an ordinary guy, wasting an ordinary life on playing games and watching anime. His life starts to change the moment he finds himself transported to an another world, full of magic and wizardry. Now chosen by fate, he is in a hurry to conquer this new world and the pussies of all lewd girls in the Cunningham Academy of Magical Arts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485860/extras/daf712b9a76315141d4d0ad7a914a098.poster.avif?t=1748604872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485860/extras/daf712b9a76315141d4d0ad7a914a098.webm?t=1748604872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485860/extras/468c0d5f2f982cf1b12be4ff4f5e0c1e.poster.avif?t=1748604872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485860/extras/468c0d5f2f982cf1b12be4ff4f5e0c1e.webm?t=1748604872\" type